title: The Agricultural Bargain
subtitle: PSL does not regard rural policy as a portfolio another partner gets to redefine.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and agriculture_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_agricultural_bargain_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_agricultural_bargain_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/rural-hinge.webp

= The Agricultural Bargain

PSL agreed to a Left agriculture minister only after converting half the
appointment into a running negotiation. Farm organisations want prices and
predictability; rural households want services that do not disappear at the
county boundary.

- @rural_settlement
- @psl_bargain
- @market_audit

@rural_settlement
title: Tie farm security to rural public services
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Write a Left settlement in PSL's strongest territory.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The farm guarantees and rural services require two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; rural_support += 6; household_security += 4; health_capacity += 2; government_delivery += 4; fiscal_stress += 1; psl_coalition_dissent += 6; psl_relation -= 4; news_headline = "The Agriculture Ministry links farm security to clinics, transport and local services"

The package treats rural Poland as a place where people live, work and need a
state—not only as a production lobby. PSL recognises much of its programme and
none of its assumed ownership.

- #poland_card_finish


@psl_bargain
title: Let PSL co-write the implementation
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Secure delivery by sharing authorship.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: County negotiations and joint implementation require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_support += 3; psl_relation += 5; psl_coalition_dissent -= 4; local_network += 3; government_delivery += 2; progressive_credibility -= 1; news_headline = "The Left and PSL agree a county-level rural implementation pact"

PSL mayors and county networks receive a formal role in delivery. The policy
will move; the coalition partner will also claim that it moved only because
PSL corrected the ministry.

- #poland_card_finish


@market_audit
title: Publish margins, contracts and concentration
subtitle: Free fallback. Start with the power between farms and shelves, and finish with two organised enemies.
on-arrival: rural_support += 2; household_security += 2; public_trust += 2; inflation -= 0.2; psl_coalition_dissent += 4; household_policy_pressure += 2; ko_coalition_dissent += 2 if government_party != "pis"; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "The Agriculture Ministry opens the food chain's margins and contracts"

The audit shows where farm-gate prices, processor power and retail margins
diverge. It offers no immediate cheque, but shifts the argument away from
ritual subsidy auctions and toward who sets the terms.

- #poland_card_finish
